{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷や奴を食した。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は6枚目の制作でバタバタしてましたが、昨日やっと落ち着きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏ソング間違いなしです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル大阪公演で初披露するので、楽しみにしててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしゃ、頑張るぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイトハイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/05/28/2636380/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、さゆりんのガチ恋熱が上昇してきました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まいちゃんが眼鏡してる〜〜〜かわいい〜〜〜目キョロキョロしてるぅぅぅ〜〜はぁぁ〜〜〜♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あっ、お金大丈夫やで〜その変わり...いっぱいちゅーして貰お〜〜〜♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「毎日毎日、まいちゃんのこと見てるけど...まいちゃんの細部まで見てるけど...一向に飽きないよ〜〜〜♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに度が超えすぎて、ちょっと...って思うこともあるけど、可愛いやつです笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりちゃーーーーーーーん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/05/28/2636380/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はそんなさゆりんと、ホワイトハイの相方かずみんとサムライELOさんの撮影です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海に行ってきたよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はみんなで麺類を食べてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまし♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！6月3日に私が表紙をやらせていただいた「Gフラッシュ」が発売になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、全部で17ページもあるみたいです。いろんな衣装を着たり、小さい頃の写真もあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ったりするので、どんな風になっているかすごく楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもよかったら、見てみてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}